  "description": "Huawei SmartAX MA5600T 16-service-slot all-in-one copper/fibre access platform. Counted here: one H805VDMF 48-port VDSL2-over-POTS board in slot 1 (ports 0/1/0-47, VDSL2 17a/8b, MELT, G.INP, ADSL2+ backwards compatible) plus the SCUN control board's 4x GE optical uplinks (SFP) = 52 ports. An H801X2CS uplink board adds 2x 10GE SFP+ and 64-port VDPD/VDQM boards raise the line side to 64.",
